/-!
# Results of the high-resolution ball chain of the guiding-centre torus family

The full chain, the value bounds `‖X c i‖ ≤ B i + E i` and the norm nodes
(distances to the low-resolution family and residuals),
for every parameter `|c| = 1`. Generated by `scripts/gc_kam/ew_emit_lean.py`.

Energy-window node 4: gyro-length `ρ_4 = 1/256 + 2⁻³²`, its own family torus `K_4(λ)`; the
fields at `ρ_4` are the nodes `DtJ`, `nRtJ`, `nZtJ`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

set_option linter.style.longLine false

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC

